// RA2 fixture: the economy of the small two sided world of the RA1 fixture, with five more
// buildings for the rules of RA2: the bunker (a defence that needs no power, as the Pillbox),
// the sentry (a powered defence that consumes none, as the Sentry Gun), the wall, the depot
// (repairs vehicles) and the vault (at most two per player). The turret consumes power, as the
// Prism Tower. The sell values are half the cost, and the rules refund 40 percent, so that a
// test tells which of the two a sale pays. Fixture data (invariant I10).
